{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asterion Quest is an 8-bit side-scrolling action platformer, with classic retro mechanics and linear level design.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through dark lands, where no man dares to tread, and face the most hostile creatures as the warrior prince Asterios III, on a quest for his adventure companion, Livia Astergate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906840/extras/2629e85a710b9f086d446545a36f16ec.poster.avif?t=1754067289\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906840/extras/2629e85a710b9f086d446545a36f16ec.webm?t=1754067289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906840/extras/2629e85a710b9f086d446545a36f16ec.mp4?t=1754067289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 levels of classic linear design.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8-bit style graphics, based on the NES palette.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure old school action!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+10 different weapons, equipment and items to collect!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huge bosses!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game secrets and alternative endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death counter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extras, including New Game+, Boss Rush mode, Speedrunner mode, and Sound Test!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906840/extras/749db4502ffb0c5fcdd06af8d388d2fb.poster.avif